{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-raffles-the-palm-dubai","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"raffles-the-palm-dubai-epg-palm-jumeirah","about":"Offering a branded selection of 2, 3, 4, and 5-bedroom apartments, 4-bedroom villas, and 5 and 6-bedroom penthouses, Raffles Residences &amp; Penthouses, The Palm Dubai redefines ultra-luxury living in the heart of Palm Jumeirah. Nestled on the prestigious Crescent West, this exquisite development by EPG blends world-class hospitality with bespoke sophistication, catering to discerning homeowners and investors. Each residence is meticulously designed with high-end furnishings, custom-crafted kitchens, spa-inspired bathrooms, and expansive terraces boasting private pools and Jacuzzis, all complemented by breathtaking views of the Dubai skyline, Arabian Gulf, and pristine beaches.Residents indulge in 24-hour concierge and security services, private elevators, a state-of-the-art gym, beach club, fine dining options, and access to the legendary Raffles hospitality services, including personal butlers, private chefs, luxury limousine services, and event planning. With full access to premium hotel amenities and a host of tailored lifestyle services, Raffles Residences &amp; Penthouses offers the pinnacle of resort-style living in one of Dubai’s most prestigious locations.","price":null,"title":"Raffles The Palm Dubai","bitrix":{"id":652,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Raffles The Palm Dubai","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Raffles The Palm Dubai","property_type":"Penthouse","developer_name":"EPG","project_location":"Palm Jumeirah"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Raffles_Residences_and_Penthouses_The_Palm_Duba_7efaa05578.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Raffles_Residences_and_Penthouses_The_Palm_Duba_7efaa05578.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.11